+[#2345]: https://github.com/RustCrypto/formats/pull/2345
+[#2379]: https://github.com/RustCrypto/formats/pull/2379
+
 ## 0.8.0 (2026-02-13)
 ### Added
 - Custom error types support to the `Decode` and `DecodeValue` traits ([#1055])
